  "body": "Refs #6036 (task 13003) — no closing keyword; issue #6036 closes only per its own done criteria.\n\nLands the offset-matching design record under `doc/`, following the existing atlas design-doc naming (`doc/<timestamp>_design_atlas_<slug>/`):\n\n- **Settled parameters:** Gear rolling hash, 64-byte window at 1–2 KB embed spans; BLAKE3 strong verify with byte comparison before any copy token is emitted; minimum interior anchor run 128 bytes, with a boundary rule for byte-verified runs at file/token edges.\n- **Output contract:** ordered `copy`/`literal` token stream with contiguity and byte-verification invariants, plus the resolution rules into span references.\n- **#6035 cross-reference, stated as a dependency:** sub-span ranges must be re-embedded as new spans under #6035's own byte-identical-reuse invariant; the record recommends split-on-reference and notes the whole-span-only fallback (round outward) and its cost if #6035 lands that way.\n- **Cost model:** matcher CPU/reads vs embeddings saved, per source type (prose, code, append-mostly logs, prepend-heavy logs, generated files), including the per-offset index memory cost.\n- **Failure cases:** reflow/re-wrap phantom diffs, sub-`MIN_MATCH` edit spacing, weak-hash collision storms, adversarial collisions (CPU-only, never correctness), tiny files, encoding changes.\n- **Worked run** over the issue's 17–241 example, producing the three-token stream and its resolution.\n\nDesign only — no implementation, per the packet scope.\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796725758&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7638&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7638&signature=8e3f6d8fa452d0323f4aaedbd50db89d18a4fe4b8f9d768f0ed0992ca0a36d0d\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/7638?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\">Open in [code]smith</a> · Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
